                                                "example_id": "e5ff8bef-21fb-4aea-a7be-ad64a2004020",
                                                "sense_id": "ff15f97e-a707-3b72-bff2-97e92939f69f",
                                                "text": "“My Continental prominence is improving,” I commented dryly.\n Von Lindowe cut at a furze bush with his silver-mounted rattan.\n “Quite so,” he said as dryly, his hand at his mustache. “I may say if your intentions were known your life would not be worth a curse.”"
                                            },
